    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Concussive Fist"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(incapacitation)\n\nA living creature hit by Sharkosa's knuckle duster must attempt a 23 Fortitude save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is immune to this ability for the next 24 hours.\n- **Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Failure:** The creature is confused for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is confused for 1 round and falls prone."
            },
            "id": "16db8440-90a1-4984-ac72-df1d62f924c8",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:08.413594"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Golden Bullets"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, transmutation)\n\nSharkosa's supernatural connection to gold allows her to alter the trajectory of her gold-cased bullets in flight. As long as her target is within 120 feet, Sharkosa gains a +1 circumstance bonus to ranged Strikes against targets with lesser cover and a +2 circumstance bonus to ranged Strikes against targets with standard or greater cover."
            },
            "id": "bc86d0a9-3250-4962-950c-93ba49b1b9b1",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:08.413594"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Sneak Attack"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Sharkosa deals an extra 2d6 precision damage to flat-footed creatures."
            },
            "id": "323a6330-e214-4305-8417-5b0e5e1b38ea",
